1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:01,940
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:03,510
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:04,980
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:07,280
(Episode 49)

5
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,380
Are you heading out?

6
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:20,050
Yes, I was going to clean up
the cafe's front flower beds.

7
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:21,590
Can we talk for a second?

8
00:01:22,490 --> 00:01:23,790
- Right now?
- Yes.

9
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:36,230
Has Mi Rae said anything yet?

10
00:01:36,270 --> 00:01:37,270
The boss?

11
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,470
No, did something happen?

12
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,940
Attorney Seo...

13
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:45,180
It looks like...

14
00:01:46,510 --> 00:01:49,210
he died trying to help me.

15
00:01:50,620 --> 00:01:51,880
He was preparing for my retrial.

16
00:01:54,390 --> 00:01:55,520
Are you sure about that?

17
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:58,420
I was only guessing
that might be the case.

18
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,760
Remember when I mentioned...

19
00:02:01,630 --> 00:02:03,600
Manager Na's daughter
coming to visit me?

20
00:02:04,430 --> 00:02:07,900
Turns out Attorney Seo
was looking into him.

21
00:02:09,170 --> 00:02:10,170
Really?

22
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:15,540
Honestly, I never thought
it was just a random attack either.

23
00:02:16,210 --> 00:02:17,980
That's exactly why
I started digging into it too.

24
00:02:18,480 --> 00:02:19,480
Anyway,

25
00:02:21,180 --> 00:02:22,180
I think...

26
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:26,120
she wants our family to move out.

27
00:02:27,550 --> 00:02:29,620
It seems like she feels
uncomfortable seeing you, too.

28
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,160
All right.

29
00:02:33,260 --> 00:02:35,890
I'll go to work today
and talk to the boss.

30
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,670
You're here, boss.

31
00:02:41,970 --> 00:02:42,970
What happened to your foot?

32
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,200
This?

33
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,870
- It's no big deal.
- Let me see.

34
00:02:48,440 --> 00:02:50,640
Is it broken? Where did this happen?

35
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,310
I'm fine.

36
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,950
It's only a hairline fracture.

37
00:02:54,410 --> 00:02:56,610
Where have you been
and what have you been doing?

38
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,450
Yesterday,

39
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,750
I went back to the place
where Attorney Seo died.

40
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,250
You went to that warehouse?

41
00:03:03,590 --> 00:03:06,090
I went just in case
the police had missed anything,

42
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,860
and I lost my footing.

43
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:09,960
But I'm fine.

44
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:11,900
I have no trouble walking.

45
00:03:12,660 --> 00:03:14,630
Why would you go there, Eun Guk?

46
00:03:15,230 --> 00:03:17,100
Didn't you hear
what the police said?

47
00:03:17,370 --> 00:03:18,740
They said there are
no cameras around...

48
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,410
and hardly anyone
passes through there.

49
00:03:22,370 --> 00:03:23,370
Don't worry.

50
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:25,540
Nothing happened.

51
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:31,980
You heard from Eun Seol, right?

52
00:03:35,690 --> 00:03:37,620
You don't need to come in
for your shift starting tomorrow.

53
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:41,030
I'll tally up your pay through today
and transfer it to your account.

54
00:03:41,530 --> 00:03:44,000
Also, let me know
once you find a place to move.

55
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:45,960
Boss.

56
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:50,540
If Attorney Seo really died
trying to help Eun Seol,

57
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,000
I won't let it slide.

58
00:03:52,570 --> 00:03:54,710
If the police can't uncover it,
I will.

59
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:59,040
I'll find whoever did this to him,
no matter what.

60
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:02,380
Doing that
won't bring Hyun Jae back.

61
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:08,750
Hyun Jae really cared
about Eun Seol a lot.

62
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:10,820
He wanted to step up for her
as a man.

63
00:04:12,260 --> 00:04:14,790
But Eun Seol ultimately
rejected those feelings.

64
00:04:16,430 --> 00:04:17,600
Still,

65
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:22,370
Hyun Jae died helping her
until the very end.

66
00:04:22,370 --> 00:04:24,070
So, how could I face Eun Seol?

67
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:25,670
How am I supposed
to look at you, Eun Guk?

68
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:29,110
Please see things
from my perspective too.

69
00:04:39,250 --> 00:04:40,650
What happened last night?

70
00:04:40,650 --> 00:04:42,320
I told you.

71
00:04:42,450 --> 00:04:43,550
I was out drinking
with CEO Park until dawn,

72
00:04:43,620 --> 00:04:45,020
then hit the sauna.

73
00:04:45,220 --> 00:04:46,660
Then you should've let me know.

74
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,160
Your phone was turned off,

75
00:04:48,490 --> 00:04:50,060
and you didn't call until dawn.

76
00:04:50,060 --> 00:04:53,260
I just didn't want to call
and wake you for no good reason.

77
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,500
No matter how late you drank,

78
00:04:56,570 --> 00:04:58,400
you've never slept anywhere
besides home.

79
00:04:58,870 --> 00:05:00,810
Tell me about it.

80
00:05:01,510 --> 00:05:05,680
I guess I really overdid it.
I still feel so exhausted.

81
00:05:07,150 --> 00:05:09,480
(Cheongma Scholarship Foundation,
Chairman Kim Jung Sun)

82
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:19,360
Si Hyun's mom, how have you been?

83
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:22,190
I know.

84
00:05:23,430 --> 00:05:26,730
Apparently my husband
and CEO Park...

85
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:28,570
went out drinking together
yesterday.

86
00:05:30,330 --> 00:05:31,340
What?

87
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,440
CEO Park stayed out all night?

88
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,680
Exactly.

89
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:41,850
It looks like CEO Park
had a lot to drink, too.

90
00:05:42,450 --> 00:05:45,080
Well, men do that once in a while.

91
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,920
Okay, let's catch up sometime soon.

92
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:51,920
Sure. Take care.

93
00:05:58,260 --> 00:06:01,200
So he practically lives
at gambling arcades now?

94
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:05,200
Yes, he was holed up
at the motel lying low for a bit,

95
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:08,670
and now he's just burning through
all his savings.

96
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:10,370
Until we get him admitted,

97
00:06:10,780 --> 00:06:13,080
check on him constantly
so he can't run off.

98
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,650
Yes, ma'am.

99
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:17,050
And...

100
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:21,020
does it look like Team Leader Kang
is adjusting well to the foundation?

101
00:06:21,090 --> 00:06:23,350
It seems she still needs
a little more time.

102
00:06:23,790 --> 00:06:26,220
After all, it's quite different
from her work in Design.

103
00:06:26,660 --> 00:06:28,160
She was team lead over there,

104
00:06:28,330 --> 00:06:31,860
so it's hard for her to swallow
that Eun Seol is her senior...

105
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:34,400
on this project.

106
00:06:34,870 --> 00:06:35,870
I bet.

107
00:06:36,430 --> 00:06:38,200
Team Leader Kang
has never had to learn...

108
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,940
how to work under someone else.

109
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:44,010
So please look out for her,
Secretary Choi.

110
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,980
If you stand by her now,

111
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:49,580
she'll start to see you
as one of her own.

112
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:51,880
You know...

113
00:06:52,350 --> 00:06:56,350
that she'll inherit the chairmanship
at the foundation.

114
00:06:58,220 --> 00:06:59,220
Yes,

115
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:00,930
I'll do as ordered.

116
00:07:06,130 --> 00:07:07,570
Speed up, will you?

117
00:07:08,070 --> 00:07:09,400
Do you even know
how to read a proposal?

118
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,540
The design quality is actually
better than I expected.

119
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,240
Of course it is.

120
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:16,470
I'm the head
of the Cheongma Group Design Team.

121
00:07:17,740 --> 00:07:18,840
By the way,

122
00:07:19,340 --> 00:07:21,450
where do you plan to show
this promotional video?

123
00:07:21,650 --> 00:07:22,650
What do you mean?

124
00:07:23,710 --> 00:07:25,120
Out of three minutes,

125
00:07:25,180 --> 00:07:27,350
two minutes and 50 seconds
focus solely on Cheongma.

126
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:28,750
Don't you get how PR works?

127
00:07:28,990 --> 00:07:30,690
It's going out
under Cheongma's name,

128
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,460
so Cheongma obviously
has to be the main focus.

129
00:07:32,490 --> 00:07:34,560
That's for Cheongma's PR team
to handle.

130
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,590
This is the scholarship foundation.

131
00:07:37,090 --> 00:07:38,830
Do you still not get the difference?

132
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,230
Watch your mouth.

133
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:43,600
- Do you know who I...
- You saw the great response...

134
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:46,570
to Eun Seol's interview, right?

135
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:49,010
I did, so what?

136
00:07:52,380 --> 00:07:54,510
Put in at least
half the sincerity...

137
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:57,080
Eun Seol did.

138
00:08:00,650 --> 00:08:03,350
Make the changes,
and I'll take another look.

139
00:08:03,550 --> 00:08:06,420
This is already plenty good.
What's there to revise?

140
00:08:06,420 --> 00:08:08,930
What if we submit this
to the Chairman as is?

141
00:08:08,930 --> 00:08:12,230
She'll say you don't even get
what scholarship programs are for.

142
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:34,020
Oh, my legs.

143
00:08:34,390 --> 00:08:39,490
A few house viewings,
and they've run an old woman ragged.

144
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:41,330
House viewings?

145
00:08:41,690 --> 00:08:42,690
Mom, did you go...

146
00:08:43,090 --> 00:08:44,630
to a realtor or something?

147
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:45,800
Yes, I did.

148
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:48,270
If we stay, Eun Guk won't ever
come to his senses.

149
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,240
What do you mean,
come to his senses?

150
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,040
He's already head over heels
for Teun Teun's mom.

151
00:08:53,070 --> 00:08:54,270
This won't do.

152
00:08:55,370 --> 00:08:59,110
Even a shantytown would be fine,
so let's pack our bags right now.

153
00:09:00,310 --> 00:09:02,510
You think
we can afford anything there?

154
00:09:03,010 --> 00:09:06,320
With the money we have,
we can't even afford a single room.

155
00:09:06,850 --> 00:09:08,920
Teun Teun's mom was kind enough
to take us in.

156
00:09:09,250 --> 00:09:12,860
If we pack up and leave,
we'll end up on the street.

157
00:09:12,890 --> 00:09:14,390
Unbelievable.

158
00:09:14,390 --> 00:09:17,900
How did my life end up
in such a miserable state?

159
00:09:18,930 --> 00:09:20,730
They say bad luck
rubs off on people.

160
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:24,170
Eun Seol's cursed fate
must've rubbed off on me.

161
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:25,800
Otherwise,

162
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:29,540
Wang Geum Ja's life
could never be this ruined.

163
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:32,780
Mom, let's be honest here.

164
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,550
If bad luck rubs off on people,

165
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:37,150
it was you who passed it on to us.

166
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:40,120
I was wondering why
my life was so messed up,

167
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:42,950
and it must be because
of your bad luck.

168
00:09:43,420 --> 00:09:45,260
Fine, it was me.

169
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:48,230
While you're at it,
dump your cursed mother...

170
00:09:48,730 --> 00:09:51,100
out on the street.

171
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,230
Just throw me away.

172
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:55,930
- Darn, my legs.
- What?

173
00:09:56,570 --> 00:09:58,570
- What is it?
- Massage my legs, will you?

174
00:09:58,740 --> 00:09:59,740
What...

175
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,170
Hold on.

176
00:10:02,140 --> 00:10:03,240
Stretch them out.

177
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,950
(Planning Director, Cha Seok Jin)

178
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,380
- Seok Jin.
- Yes?

179
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:14,790
Do you know
Director Joo's new secretary?

180
00:10:14,850 --> 00:10:16,520
Yes, I've seen him a few times.

181
00:10:17,250 --> 00:10:19,120
Aren't you working on
the scholarship program together?

182
00:10:19,190 --> 00:10:20,220
We are.

183
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:23,060
He's a nobody,
yet he gets on my nerves so much.

184
00:10:23,590 --> 00:10:25,260
Even if I'm not familiar
with the foundation's work,

185
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,860
I'm still technically his superior.

186
00:10:27,130 --> 00:10:29,870
Yet he treats me
like I work for him.

187
00:10:30,330 --> 00:10:31,940
Sounds like you met your match.

188
00:10:32,470 --> 00:10:34,270
Secretary Choi didn't seem
like a pushover.

189
00:10:34,340 --> 00:10:36,510
Honestly, he's worse
than Ko Eun Seol.

190
00:10:36,770 --> 00:10:38,010
Whenever I provoke Eun Seol
even a little,

191
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,310
he gets even more riled up.

192
00:10:39,380 --> 00:10:41,280
Who does he think he is,
her bodyguard?

193
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:45,320
Director Joo will pick up
our engagement attire tomorrow.

194
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:47,620
Let's go pick up the rings together
after work.

195
00:10:47,750 --> 00:10:48,820
Sure, let's do that.

196
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,860
Just a few days left now.

197
00:10:52,260 --> 00:10:55,160
Don't couples usually tie the knot
a year after getting engaged?

198
00:10:57,660 --> 00:10:59,930
- About the CEO...
- What about my dad?

199
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:03,170
Why do you think he suddenly
had a change of heart?

200
00:11:04,170 --> 00:11:05,800
He was always opposed
to our marriage.

201
00:11:06,070 --> 00:11:07,440
I told you before.

202
00:11:07,710 --> 00:11:10,270
He changed his mind
after dinner with your mom.

203
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:13,280
- The dinner with my mom?
- Yes.

204
00:11:13,710 --> 00:11:16,210
Ms. Park has this way
of making people feel sorry for her.

205
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:20,480
What I'm saying is,

206
00:11:20,550 --> 00:11:23,490
seeing your mom probably
made him think of your dad.

207
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:24,660
They were pretty close, right?

208
00:11:24,990 --> 00:11:26,020
Unbelievable.

209
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,360
Anyway,

210
00:11:27,430 --> 00:11:30,060
I'm pretty sure your mother
moved our engagement along.

211
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:33,360
Dad cares about her a lot.

212
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:35,830
When she went
for her hospital checkup,

213
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:37,670
he told Director Joo to go with her.

214
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:40,540
With the Director?

215
00:11:40,940 --> 00:11:41,970
Yes.

216
00:11:49,010 --> 00:11:51,150
- Mr. Seok Jin.
- Yes?

217
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:56,150
I don't want this.

218
00:11:57,150 --> 00:11:58,160
What is it?

219
00:11:58,590 --> 00:12:01,990
It's a gift from Hae Ra.

220
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,930
The Chairman and Director Joo
came by, right?

221
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:08,570
Yes. But...

222
00:12:09,130 --> 00:12:10,430
I don't like it.

223
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,810
It looks like
it would look great on you, though.

224
00:12:17,040 --> 00:12:20,280
Gifts from Hae Ra
make me uncomfortable.

225
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:23,480
I feel like
she'll just take it back later.

226
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:26,080
Hae Ra isn't that mean.

227
00:12:26,350 --> 00:12:28,490
Still, I don't want it.

228
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:31,320
So please give it back to her.

229
00:12:33,360 --> 00:12:36,030
All right. If it makes you
uncomfortable, I'll return it.

230
00:12:37,730 --> 00:12:38,730
Mom.

231
00:12:39,260 --> 00:12:40,260
Yes?

232
00:12:42,700 --> 00:12:45,240
I'm telling you this now
so you won't worry,

233
00:12:46,140 --> 00:12:48,070
but I'll still live with you
even after I get married.

234
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,640
Hae Ra won't like that.

235
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,180
No, she promised me.

236
00:12:55,180 --> 00:12:56,580
Did she pinky-promise?

237
00:12:56,880 --> 00:12:57,880
Of course.

238
00:12:58,450 --> 00:12:59,620
Really?

239
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,820
Then can I live with you...

240
00:13:02,920 --> 00:13:05,260
for a long, long time, Seok Jin?

241
00:13:05,590 --> 00:13:06,660
Absolutely.

242
00:13:07,830 --> 00:13:09,590
So don't get scared and worry
in advance.

243
00:13:10,130 --> 00:13:11,130
Okay?

244
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:14,060
Okay. I won't.

245
00:13:23,970 --> 00:13:25,940
(Joo Ae Sook's Baby (F)
Sept. 11, 2000, 11:05 p.m., 3.28kg)

246
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,890
September 11?

247
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,490
But the 11th is my birthday.

248
00:13:42,860 --> 00:13:44,500
Joo Ae Sook.

249
00:13:47,230 --> 00:13:48,430
Joo Ae Sook?

250
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:52,840
Joo Ae Sook...

251
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:59,140
(Joo Mi Ran,
Former legal name: Joo Ae Sook)

252
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,720
You said she was your friend
from high school.

253
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:15,190
What was she like in school?

254
00:14:16,690 --> 00:14:18,100
She really had her act together.

255
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:21,270
Her grades were pretty good, too.

256
00:14:24,130 --> 00:14:26,070
Then why did she abandon me?

257
00:14:27,870 --> 00:14:30,270
Do you know why she abandoned me?

258
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:34,980
Things were very hard for her.

259
00:14:36,550 --> 00:14:38,020
She grew up in an orphanage.

260
00:14:38,220 --> 00:14:39,320
An orphanage?

261
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,150
Yes. She was an orphan.

262
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:51,500
(With Ae Sook at the orphanage)

263
00:14:56,670 --> 00:14:59,240
(Name: Na Tae Hoon,
Background: Hope Orphanage)

264
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:03,340
Then Director Joo...

265
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:06,810
grew up in an orphanage?

266
00:15:18,920 --> 00:15:21,330
I went just in case
the police had missed anything,

267
00:15:22,060 --> 00:15:23,360
and I lost my footing.

268
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:25,260
But I'm fine.

269
00:15:26,130 --> 00:15:27,260
I have no trouble walking.

270
00:15:27,970 --> 00:15:31,200
I'll find whoever did this to him,
no matter what.

271
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:41,910
Teun Teun,

272
00:15:42,850 --> 00:15:44,420
I won't waver anymore.

273
00:15:46,850 --> 00:15:49,250
I'll do my best
for your uncle's sake as well...

274
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:51,920
and protect you.

275
00:15:53,460 --> 00:15:54,490
Okay?

276
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:03,370
Eun Guk, come sit down.

277
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:19,180
What's this?

278
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:22,490
I was going to wire the money,
but I thought this would be better.

279
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:32,030
I added a little extra
on top of the hours you worked.

280
00:16:32,430 --> 00:16:33,430
So...

281
00:16:34,530 --> 00:16:35,600
is this severance pay?

282
00:16:36,730 --> 00:16:38,940
I'll help you look for a new place.

283
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:41,540
Boss...

284
00:16:42,610 --> 00:16:43,840
This isn't right.

285
00:16:44,210 --> 00:16:45,240
I told you.

286
00:16:45,780 --> 00:16:47,140
Please understand my position.

287
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:48,510
What about mine?

288
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,180
Put yourself in my shoes.

289
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:54,220
If I lost my whole family
and had no one left,

290
00:16:55,350 --> 00:16:57,350
would you really
just abandon me like this?

291
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:02,030
Yes, I would.

292
00:17:02,930 --> 00:17:03,960
Boss...

293
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:07,200
I...

294
00:17:08,770 --> 00:17:10,930
I keep wanting to lean on you.

295
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:13,670
Sure.

296
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:16,410
Seeing you brings me joy...

297
00:17:17,410 --> 00:17:18,440
and makes my heart race.

298
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:23,280
Even if only for a moment,
I can forget about all my troubles.

299
00:17:23,450 --> 00:17:25,750
That's why I'm saying
I'll stay with you.

300
00:17:26,280 --> 00:17:27,350
But...

301
00:17:28,250 --> 00:17:29,850
the happier I am,

302
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:33,060
the more guilty I feel
toward Hyun Jae.

303
00:17:43,370 --> 00:17:45,000
It just dawned on me.

304
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:48,040
What would Attorney Seo have said
in this situation?

305
00:17:49,170 --> 00:17:50,210
Well,

306
00:17:50,670 --> 00:17:52,910
he would've felt the exact same way.

307
00:17:54,450 --> 00:17:56,710
He'd want me to stay by your side
and protect you.

308
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:01,850
So, forget about my severance pay.

309
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,530
I'll go check on the inventory.

310
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,480
Director Joo.

311
00:18:44,630 --> 00:18:46,600
There's something
I wanted to ask you.

312
00:18:49,030 --> 00:18:53,740
You and my mom really never saw
each other after graduation, right?

313
00:18:54,970 --> 00:18:56,040
Right.

314
00:18:56,640 --> 00:18:59,010
We took different paths in life,

315
00:18:59,280 --> 00:19:01,610
and we were both just too busy
with our own lives.

316
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:04,550
You didn't keep in touch, either?

317
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,080
No, we didn't.

318
00:19:08,150 --> 00:19:09,420
I just find it a bit odd.

319
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,820
If you were so close,

320
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,090
you'd have kept in touch...

321
00:19:15,890 --> 00:19:17,430
at least a few years
past graduation.

322
00:19:19,530 --> 00:19:20,700
You have a point.

323
00:19:21,430 --> 00:19:24,700
I deeply regret
that we weren't able to do that.

324
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:30,470
So before I end up
with more regrets,

325
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:32,680
I just want to look after you
properly, Eun Seol.

326
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,410
That way, I'll feel less guilty...

327
00:19:35,410 --> 00:19:36,850
when I see Hee Jung
in the afterlife.

328
00:19:38,180 --> 00:19:39,180
I see.

329
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:41,350
By the way,

330
00:19:42,250 --> 00:19:44,190
could you deliver this on your way?

331
00:19:45,820 --> 00:19:47,520
What is it?

332
00:19:48,560 --> 00:19:50,560
It's Chief Cha's suit
for the engagement.

333
00:19:50,830 --> 00:19:52,760
I have to jump
into a meeting right now.

334
00:19:54,130 --> 00:19:56,530
Please drop it off
and see if it fits.

335
00:19:57,330 --> 00:19:59,740
Team Leader Kang happens
to be away from her desk.

336
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:01,470
Can you do this for me?

337
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,370
Sure, I'll take care of it.

338
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,240
I appreciate it.

339
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,080
Right.

340
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:14,120
Come in.

341
00:20:25,700 --> 00:20:27,630
Director Joo asked me
to deliver this to you.

342
00:20:28,630 --> 00:20:29,770
What is it?

343
00:20:30,570 --> 00:20:31,800
The suit for your engagement party.

344
00:20:34,270 --> 00:20:35,610
How come you're bringing this to me?

345
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:39,540
Director Joo and Ms. Kang
both had to attend meetings.

346
00:21:00,130 --> 00:21:02,100
I was asked to check
if the size fits.

347
00:21:24,250 --> 00:21:26,820
Looks like the right fit.
How does it feel on you?

348
00:21:28,590 --> 00:21:29,660
It seems fine.

349
00:21:30,590 --> 00:21:32,000
I'll let her know.

350
00:21:33,830 --> 00:21:34,830
Ko Eun Seol.

351
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:39,700
Is there anything
I can help you with?

352
00:21:40,340 --> 00:21:42,040
No, I'm good.

353
00:22:02,830 --> 00:22:03,890
Mr. An.

354
00:22:04,090 --> 00:22:05,760
I included yesterday's pay in here.

355
00:22:06,460 --> 00:22:08,270
Gosh, thank you.

356
00:22:09,270 --> 00:22:13,600
Man, feels like a lucky day
to hit the tables.

357
00:22:17,570 --> 00:22:20,610
Would you look at that?

358
00:22:32,260 --> 00:22:33,690
- Hey.
- Hey.

359
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,570
(Adult Gaming Room)

360
00:22:56,910 --> 00:23:00,420
What? Formally invite Ko Eun Seol
to the engagement party?

361
00:23:01,120 --> 00:23:02,120
Yes.

362
00:23:02,190 --> 00:23:04,520
Why on earth should I?
She'll ruin my appetite.

363
00:23:04,860 --> 00:23:06,360
It's on purpose,

364
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:08,930
so she can see it
with her own two eyes.

365
00:23:09,460 --> 00:23:12,330
- See what?
- That Chief Cha belongs to you now,

366
00:23:12,930 --> 00:23:15,470
and that he's completely
out of her reach.

367
00:23:15,730 --> 00:23:17,370
You have to crush
her spirit like that,

368
00:23:17,530 --> 00:23:18,870
so she won't cause trouble later.

369
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:22,810
Well, I guess telling her that
never got me anywhere.

370
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:25,640
Seeing our engagement party
in person...

371
00:23:25,840 --> 00:23:28,280
ought to put Ko Eun Seol
in her place.

372
00:23:28,910 --> 00:23:31,110
It sends a clear message
to Chief Cha, too.

373
00:23:32,250 --> 00:23:34,220
That way,
he won't get any stupid ideas.

374
00:23:34,750 --> 00:23:36,890
You really are the best, Director.

375
00:23:37,220 --> 00:23:39,220
I mean, how could you be so wise?

376
00:23:40,060 --> 00:23:41,590
I truly, totally respect you.

377
00:23:49,130 --> 00:23:51,130
Director Joo, you seem busy lately.

378
00:23:52,770 --> 00:23:54,940
You even stayed out all night,
which you never do.

379
00:23:55,510 --> 00:23:58,280
A friend came to town,
so I stayed at a hotel with her.

380
00:23:58,510 --> 00:23:59,780
A friend?

381
00:24:01,010 --> 00:24:03,250
You had friends, Director Joo?

382
00:24:04,710 --> 00:24:08,220
I've never heard you talk
about meeting a friend.

383
00:24:08,590 --> 00:24:10,590
She's a long-time friend
from my hometown.

384
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,690
Back in college, I was working
so many part-time jobs...

385
00:24:12,920 --> 00:24:14,360
that I couldn't make
a single friend.

386
00:24:15,390 --> 00:24:18,230
Right, you did say that.

387
00:24:22,730 --> 00:24:23,770
By the way,

388
00:24:23,830 --> 00:24:27,470
you didn't forget about dinner
with Ms. Yang, right?

389
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:30,410
Right, I'll get everything ready
and leave you two to it.

390
00:24:30,770 --> 00:24:32,840
Gosh, why would you do that?

391
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:37,610
This dinner is for you,
Director Joo.

392
00:24:37,910 --> 00:24:40,980
That's why Young Hoon
agreed to join us.

393
00:24:41,590 --> 00:24:42,750
For me?

394
00:24:43,890 --> 00:24:47,960
Ms. Yang mentioned that
she'd arrange a blind date for you.

395
00:24:49,190 --> 00:24:51,090
She doesn't miss a thing, does she?

396
00:24:51,330 --> 00:24:54,260
She said she's bringing
a list of guys.

397
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,430
Since she's coming over,

398
00:24:57,100 --> 00:25:01,170
let's have dinner together
and help pick one out for you.

399
00:25:03,540 --> 00:25:04,540
Understood.

400
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:14,320
Gosh, what brings you here
at this hour?

401
00:25:14,850 --> 00:25:17,320
Eun Guk is out on delivery
right now.

402
00:25:17,750 --> 00:25:19,990
I came knowing he wasn't here.

403
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:22,990
I see. Please, have a seat.

404
00:25:23,630 --> 00:25:24,630
Here.

405
00:25:29,270 --> 00:25:30,300
So...

406
00:25:30,970 --> 00:25:33,340
What brings you here
so late at night?

407
00:25:35,510 --> 00:25:37,940
I have something to tell you both.

408
00:25:39,180 --> 00:25:40,280
Look at the time.

409
00:25:41,850 --> 00:25:44,850
Who barges in so rudely at bedtime
just to talk?

410
00:25:45,380 --> 00:25:46,980
Mom, just hear her out first.

411
00:25:47,780 --> 00:25:50,390
Teun Teun's mom, is something wrong?

412
00:26:08,640 --> 00:26:10,710
I'll lend you this money,

413
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:12,740
so please move out.

414
00:26:13,810 --> 00:26:15,780
Teun Teun's mom, hold on.

415
00:26:16,510 --> 00:26:19,050
If this isn't enough,
I can lend you more.

416
00:26:19,250 --> 00:26:23,920
Wait. You're offering us money
just to kick us out?

417
00:26:24,150 --> 00:26:26,960
Why? Are we carrying the plague
or something?

418
00:26:27,260 --> 00:26:28,260
No, it's not that.

419
00:26:30,330 --> 00:26:31,630
I just feel uncomfortable.

420
00:26:32,230 --> 00:26:35,200
Wait, is this about Eun Guk?

421
00:26:35,230 --> 00:26:36,930
I've said what I came here to say.

422
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:41,140
I'd appreciate it if you could start
looking for a new place right away.

423
00:26:42,170 --> 00:26:45,240
Wait, hold on. Teun Teun's mom...

424
00:26:50,810 --> 00:26:51,950
You must be thrilled, Mom.

425
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:54,150
You couldn't stop talking
about wanting to move.

426
00:26:54,480 --> 00:26:57,250
You dummy, walking out on my own...

427
00:26:57,350 --> 00:26:59,890
is totally different
from getting paid to leave.

428
00:27:05,530 --> 00:27:08,830
You know Ms. Yang's coming
to dinner tonight, right?

429
00:27:09,900 --> 00:27:11,530
That was tonight?

430
00:27:11,840 --> 00:27:12,840
Yes.

431
00:27:13,370 --> 00:27:16,110
We agreed to look over
potential blind dates...

432
00:27:16,170 --> 00:27:17,740
for Director Joo together.

433
00:27:17,940 --> 00:27:19,310
Blind dates?

434
00:27:19,540 --> 00:27:21,140
Yes, Ms. Yang said...

435
00:27:21,180 --> 00:27:25,680
she'd bring
a whole list of matches for her.

436
00:27:30,090 --> 00:27:34,420
Let's all weigh in on her options
once Ms. Yang brings over the list.

437
00:27:41,360 --> 00:27:44,430
You must've been upset
that I wanted to look for...

438
00:27:44,570 --> 00:27:45,970
my biological mother.

439
00:27:46,370 --> 00:27:49,570
Well, maybe a little bit.

440
00:28:05,320 --> 00:28:07,790
There we go.
Hey, you must be hungry.

441
00:28:08,390 --> 00:28:11,190
Once I finish this up,
I'll whip up some dinner.

442
00:28:11,260 --> 00:28:12,260
It's fine.

443
00:28:12,600 --> 00:28:14,000
Dad, there's something
I want to ask.

444
00:28:14,630 --> 00:28:15,730
Sure. What is it?

445
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:19,500
Do you know anything
about my birth mother?

446
00:28:22,970 --> 00:28:24,010
You do, don't you?

447
00:28:25,740 --> 00:28:27,980
I don't. How would I know?

448
00:28:30,410 --> 00:28:32,020
Please, tell me the truth.

449
00:28:32,450 --> 00:28:34,720
If you don't,
I'll go look for her myself.

450
00:28:34,720 --> 00:28:35,720
No, you can't.

451
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:38,590
If you look for her,
you'll be saddled with all her debt.

452
00:28:39,060 --> 00:28:40,860
Absolutely not. Never.

453
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:43,830
Dad...

454
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:52,700
Actually, we went to see
Director Joo Mi Ran...

455
00:28:53,340 --> 00:28:54,740
at your company.

456
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,610
Your grandmother and I thought...

457
00:28:57,970 --> 00:29:00,480
she was your birth mother.

458
00:29:07,620 --> 00:29:08,920
(Yeongsu High School)

459
00:29:08,990 --> 00:29:13,090
(School Life Guide
and Key Educational Activities)

460
00:29:14,660 --> 00:29:18,030
But she told us
she wasn't that Ae Sook,

461
00:29:19,000 --> 00:29:22,770
and that there was
another Joo Ae Sook at school.

462
00:29:31,540 --> 00:29:32,740
Director Joo gave me...

463
00:29:33,380 --> 00:29:34,680
the address for...

464
00:29:35,680 --> 00:29:37,580
the other Joo Ae Sook,
your real mother.

465
00:29:45,520 --> 00:29:49,330
No. No woman ever lived here.

466
00:29:49,960 --> 00:29:53,330
Only an old man lived here
all his life,

467
00:29:55,230 --> 00:29:57,300
and he passed away last year.

468
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,800
Oh, I see.

469
00:30:01,340 --> 00:30:02,940
- Thank you.
- No problem.

470
00:30:16,850 --> 00:30:17,850
Hello?

471
00:30:18,120 --> 00:30:20,620
- This is Yeongsu High School.
- Right.

472
00:30:21,090 --> 00:30:24,460
A lawyer came by some time ago
to ask about Joo Ae Sook as well.

473
00:30:25,500 --> 00:30:28,430
In that class year,
there was only one Joo Ae Sook.

474
00:30:28,970 --> 00:30:30,670
There was no other Joo Ae Sook.

475
00:30:40,180 --> 00:30:42,210
She should be here by now.
What's keeping her?

476
00:30:45,420 --> 00:30:46,420
Goodness.

477
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:49,590
Hey, Ms. Yang.

478
00:30:51,890 --> 00:30:53,990
Oh, you're going to be a bit late?

479
00:30:54,860 --> 00:30:57,330
That's fine.
Take your time and be careful.

480
00:30:58,330 --> 00:30:59,330
Don't worry about it.

481
00:31:00,160 --> 00:31:02,870
Wait. You're bringing that list...

482
00:31:02,870 --> 00:31:05,700
of blind date candidates
for Director Joo, right?

483
00:31:09,910 --> 00:31:10,910
Okay.

484
00:31:50,750 --> 00:31:54,380
(A Trap Called Desire)

485
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,750
What a shame. There's no one left
to help with your retrial.

486
00:31:56,750 --> 00:31:58,550
Maybe you should look
for another lawyer.

487
00:31:58,890 --> 00:32:01,460
Will it really give you
peace of mind if I leave?

488
00:32:01,790 --> 00:32:03,330
Fine. I'll go.

489
00:32:03,430 --> 00:32:06,160
- Has Director Joo ever...
- Marriage? Oh, please.

490
00:32:06,360 --> 00:32:09,530
She hasn't even dated anyone before.

491
00:32:09,900 --> 00:32:11,570
Director Joo should meet
a good man...

492
00:32:11,670 --> 00:32:12,840
and know what it feels like
to be loved.

493
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:15,410
I was hoping you'd come with me,
Director Joo.

494
00:32:15,670 --> 00:32:18,010
Why don't we get some fresh air?

495
00:32:18,140 --> 00:32:20,680
No matter how much I think about it,
they look alike.

496
00:32:20,740 --> 00:32:23,210
- What bugs me, I have to check.
- Get off me!

497
00:32:23,510 --> 00:32:27,280
Did you only see me
as a weight around your neck?

498
00:32:28,050 --> 00:32:30,050
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
